  "track": "track-07",
  "title": "React DOM components forms resource hints portals and preload APIs",
  "status": "source-backed-draft-generation-enabled",
  "concepts": [
    "React DOM adapts declarative React components to browser HTML, SVG, and DOM behavior.",
    "The same component names accept React props with differences in naming, controlled input behavior, refs, and event semantics.",
    "React 19 form Actions and resource hints connect UI rendering to browser submission and loading.",
    "Browser-only APIs should be distinguished from core React APIs and server renderer entry points."
  ],
